  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:137px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Counterfeit_Foreman.PNG\" title=\"Counterfeiter Foreman\"><img alt=\"Counterfeiter Foreman\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"163\" src=\"/images/Counterfeit_Foreman.PNG\" width=\"135\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Counterfeit_Foreman.PNG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Counterfeiter Foreman</div></div></div>\n<p>The Counterfeiter Foreman is a large <a href=\"/wiki/Angel\" title=\"Angel\">Divine Angel</a> Champion found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> Level 6.  Se is the object of the Quest <a href=\"/wiki/King's_Coin_Counterfeit_Conspiracy_Part_4\" title=\"King's Coin Counterfeit Conspiracy Part 4\">King's Coin Counterfeit Conspiracy Part 4</a> given by <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Ving_N'Seacressy\" title=\"Sir Ving N'Seacressy\">Sir Ving N'Seacressy</a>. She's surrounded by a divine mob of lookouts (<a href=\"/wiki/Felknight\" title=\"Felknight\">Felknights</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Angel\" title=\"Angel\">Angels</a>).\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
